# The build context is the whole repository (for pyproject.toml), which is
# hundreds of MB with .venv and .git. Allowlist only what the Dockerfile COPYs;
# everything else reaches the container through the /repo bind mount instead.
*
!pyproject.toml
!docker/blender/start_server.py
!docker/blender/healthcheck.py
!docker/blender/entrypoint.sh
